	(text "PIN 1 - GND\nPin 2 VCC 5V\nPin 3 V-CH\nPin 4 SWB-\nPin 5 SWA\nPin 6 CH0 (NC)\nPin 7 SWB+\nPin 8 - NC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "793d58c8-62d5-4164-8970-f2c10dfac7f5")
	)
	(text "SWA (pin 5) rules the SOLO switch. This pin is 0V when the SOLO gain is ON, and \n5V when the SOLO is OFF\nSWB+ and SWB- (pin 7 and 4) are connected together (I don't know how MESA has \ncalled this \"+\" and \"-\") and it controls the FX switch: 0V FX is OFF, 5V FX is ON\nV-CH is the only one pin that controls the three channels of the Amps. V-CH at 0,7V \nmeaning CH1 (Channel 1) selected, 1,25V meaning CH2, 1,90V meaning CH3\nVcc (pin 2) provide the power to the BigFoot, so it's is perfect to use to power the \narduino too"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7959b7c4-8182-476f-9397-2380bf675432")
	)
